  "solution": "Vì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> giao mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> tại <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tĐiểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tMà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> trên mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là cạnh huyền <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tMà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tMà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của B trên mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tPhương trình đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tKhi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
